## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design extensible runtime components with interchangeable strategies and clear interfaces. It probes concurrency, isolation, observability, and dynamic behavior without recompiling.

## Key Concepts
- Strategy pattern and registry-driven extensibility
- Thread-safety and per-key state management
- Observability: metrics, tracing, and alerts
- Per-route and per-client quota isolation

## Code Example
